                                                "sense_id": "aa2eb5a1-ed22-301a-afcf-63e446bad434",
                                                "text": "Nighttime fell like the opening / In the final act of the beginning of time"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "648d6c53-009b-4f8d-b94d-f1bfaa04ea18",
                                                "sense_id": "aa2eb5a1-ed22-301a-afcf-63e446bad434",
                                                "text": "Smith Barney, for example, goes so far as to shift the hours during which taxi rides home are expensable as nighttime lengthens and shortens, says Moszkowski."
